{"id":"H2660","lemma":"חֵ֫פֶר","transliteration":"chepher","sayIt":"CHE-pher","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Hepher","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Manasseh living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Num.26.32;\nson of: Gilead (H1568H);\nbrother of: Abiezer (H0044I), Helek (H2507), Asriel (H0844), Shechem (H7928) and Shemida (H8061);\nfather of: Zelophehad (H6765)\nAlso named: cheph.ri (חֶפְרִי \"Hepherite\" H2662)\n§ Hepher = \"a well\"\n1) youngest son of Gilead and head of the family of Hepherites\n2) son of Asher, the father of Tekoa\n3) the Mecherathite, one of David's mighty warriors","glosses":["hepher","shemida"],"count":9,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"num-26","v":32,"renderings":{"bsb":"from Hepher","kjv":"and of Hepher"}},{"chapterId":"num-26","v":33,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Hepher","kjv":"of Hepher"}},{"chapterId":"num-27","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Hepher","kjv":"of Hepher"}},{"chapterId":"jos-12","v":17,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Hepher","kjv":"of Hepher"}},{"chapterId":"jos-17","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"Shemida","kjv":"of Hepher"}},{"chapterId":"jos-17","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Hepher","kjv":"of Hepher"}},{"chapterId":"1ki-4","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Hepher","kjv":"of Hepher"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-4","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"Hepher","kjv":"and Hepher"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-11","v":36,"renderings":{"bsb":"Hepher","kjv":"Hepher"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Numbers 26:32","note":"and Shemida, the family of the Shemidaites; and Hepher, the family of the Hepherites.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Joshua 12:17","note":"the king of Tappuah, one; the king of Hepher, one;","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Kings 4:10","note":"Ben Hesed, in Arubboth (Socoh and all the land of Hepher belonged to him);","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 4:6","note":"Naarah bore him Ahuzzam, Hepher, Temeni, and Haahashtari. These were the sons of Naarah.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H2662","lemma":"חֶפְרִי","transliteration":"chephri","gloss":"